<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Jan-Feb trade deficit narrows to $30.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Jan-Feb trade deficit narrows to $30.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan posted a trade deficit of $30.8 million in the first two months of this year compared to $56.4 million in the same period in 1996, the Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of dollars).</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ FOREIGN TRADE   Jan-Feb 97    Jan-Feb 96</p>
<p>    Export			61.2	    52.7</p>
<p>    Import			92.0	   109.1</p>
<p>    Balance		    -30.8	   -56.4</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
